remove deletes the provider's key from the daemon. Every job that calls
the provider ends with CREDENTIAL_MISSING, because it can make no further
call. The model a feature uses stays chosen, so 'ley ai add' with a new key
puts the feature back to work.

--json prints {} once the key is gone.

Usage:
  ley ai remove <provider> [flags]

Examples:
  ley ai remove anthropic

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for remove

Global Flags:
      --ascii           draw with ASCII only (no box, bar or tree glyphs)
      --color string    colour output: auto, always or never (default "auto")
      --json            machine output: proto3 JSON (NDJSON for streams)
      --socket string   daemon socket path (default: user daemon UDS, $LEYLINE_SOCKET)
